auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # SuperCarl API (Bruno)

  Open this folder in Bruno (Open Collection), pick the "live-aws" environment,
  then run: 1 - Get token -> 2 - Submit research -> 3 - Get task (poll).
  Token and taskId are wired automatically via post-response scripts.
}
